 "answer": "CD-10413: Customer Inquiry\n\nDear Customer,\n\nThank you for reaching out regarding your refund request. Your charge of $19.99 was made on October 30th, which falls within the 30-day eligibility window for a full refund according to our refund policy.\n\nTo ensure a smooth refund process, please follow these steps:\n\n1. Open Organization Settings.\n2. Navigate to \"Billing\" > \"Invoices.\"\n3. Select the invoice for the charge.\n4. Click \"Request Refund.\"\n5. Enter the reason for the request and submit it.\n\nYour refund request has been submitted to Billing, and we expect it to reach your original payment method within the timeframe outlined in our refund policy. No further action is required from your end.\n\nWe appreciate",
